      "A well-loved village pastor appears one Sunday wearing a plain black veil over his face, and never removes it or explains why, forcing his congregation to confront the secrets they themselves keep hidden. Inspired by Nathaniel Hawthorne's classic tale.",
    readingTime: 8,
