    description:
      "A meticulous law office hires a quiet new copyist who performs brilliantly for exactly three days, then begins calmly declining every task with a single unshakable phrase, unraveling the entire office's assumptions about work, authority, and obligation. Inspired by Herman Melville's classic tale, \"Bartleby, the Scrivener.\"",
    readingTime: 8,
